### Custom Questions API Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@creatorUserId = 5
@questionId = 1
@chapterId = LC5H0102

### Create a custom question
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/custom?creatorUserId={{creatorUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "chapterId": "{{chapterId}}",
  "questionText": "What is 2 + 2?",
  "optionA": "3",
  "optionB": "4",
  "optionC": "5",
  "optionD": "6",
  "correctAnswer": "B",
  "questionType": 1,
  "difficultyLevel": "Easy",
  "explanation": "Basic addition",
  "usageType": "Practice"
}

### Get all custom questions by creator
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/custom/creator/{{creatorUserId}}

### Get custom questions by creator and chapter
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/custom/creator/{{creatorUserId}}/chapter/{{chapterId}}

### Update question visibility to PUBLIC
PUT {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{questionId}}/visibility?creatorUserId={{creatorUserId}}&visibility=PUBLIC

### Update question visibility to PRIVATE
PUT {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{questionId}}/visibility?creatorUserId={{creatorUserId}}&visibility=PRIVATE

### Update question visibility to SHARED
PUT {{baseUrl}}/questions/{{questionId}}/visibility?creatorUserId={{creatorUserId}}&visibility=SHARED

### Delete a custom question
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/questions/custom/{{questionId}}?creatorUserId={{creatorUserId}}

### Get all system questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/system

### Get all custom questions (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/all-custom

